kimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Siam_Center_x_JAY_B_The_2nd_Exhibition_in_Bangkok_press_conference,_13_January_2025_02_(cropped).png","author":"THHeadline","license":"CC BY 3.0"},"bio":{"text":"Lim Jae-beom, known professionally as Jay B (제이비; stylized in all caps) or Def. (데프), and formerly JB, is a South Korean singer, songwriter, and actor. After starring in the drama series Dream High 2 in 2012, he debuted as a singer first in South Korean duo JJ Project, then, two years later, in boy band Got7, for which he serves as the leader. Aside from JJ Project and Got7, is also a member of Jus2, and part of R&B/soul crew Offshore. He is the founder and creative leader of independent music label 528Hz.","title":"Jay B","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jay_B"}},"Q53316840":{"id":"Q53316840","name":"Kim Na-yun","ko":"나윤","birthName":"김나윤","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Nayun"],"birth":"1998-07-31","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["model","singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q27820706","name":"Momoland","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"website":"https://mldenter.com/momoland-profile?pgid=kfezic3p-b3d54e11-85c4-4c14-b6b5-3a98e545194e","instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/nayun_nannie/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/c6f4c5f9-6c96-4050-83b8-055c999c79c7"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q58825704":{"id":"Q58825704","name":"Yves","ko":"이브","birthName":"Ha Soo-young","birthNameEn":"Ha Soo-young","aliases":["Ha Soo Young"],"birth":"1997-05-24","death":"","birthplace":"Busan","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"2017","agencies":[{"name":"Blockberry Creative","korean":true,"id":"Q48989772","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q28025953","name":"Loona","start":"2017","end":"2023"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/yvesntual/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/8339c0c3-7a04-4b19-8ca3-b149e0d09222"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Ha Soo-young, known professionally as Yves (이브), is a South Korean singer and songwriter. She rose to prominence as a member of the South Korean girl group Loona and its sub-unit Loona yyxy. She made her debut as a solo artist on May 29, 2024, with the release of the extended play (EP) Loop.","title":"Yves (singer)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yves_%28singer%29"}},"Q59313384":{"id":"Q59313384","name":"Handong","ko":"한동","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Han Dong"],"birth":"1996-03-26","death":"","birthplace":"Wuhan","nationality":["People's Republic of China"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","dancer"],"debut":"2017","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q20684822","name":"Dreamcatcher","start":"2017","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/0.0_handong/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/299e74fa-cf2f-432c-a4bb-8e0db57c2698"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q64177448":{"id":"Q64177448","name":"Lena","ko":"강레나","birthName":"강레나","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Kang Lena"],"birth":"2002-04-17","death":"","birthplace":"Yongin","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q55715778","name":"GWSN","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kiwipop_gwsn/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/c19c7333-18a6-4ef3-bb20-f0e465150b9c"},"photo":null,"bio":null}}}